    {
      "source": "As of 6.1, this method comes with a default implementation that delegates\nto <a href=\"../../core/task/TaskExecutor.html#execute(java.lang.Runnable)\"><code>TaskExecutor.execute(Runnable)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自 6.1 版本起，此方法具有默认实现，该实现委托给 <a href=\"../../core/task/TaskExecutor.html#execute(java.lang.Runnable)\"><code>TaskExecutor.execute(Runnable)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Can be shared between a Quartz Scheduler (specified as \"taskExecutor\")\nand other TaskExecutor users, or even used completely independent of\na Quartz Scheduler (as plain TaskExecutor backend).",
      "translation": "可与 Quartz 调度器（指定为\"taskExecutor\"）和其他 TaskExecutor 用户共享，甚至可完全独立于 Quartz 调度器使用（作为普通的 TaskExecutor 后端）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> on destruction of a bean.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在销毁 Bean 时调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set whether to wait for running jobs to complete on shutdown.\nDefault is \"false\".",
      "translation": "设置是否在关闭时等待正在运行的作业完成。默认值为\"false\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>task</code> - the <code>Runnable</code> to execute (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>task</code> - 要执行的 <code>Runnable</code>(永远不为 <code>null</code>)",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a Future representing pending completion of the task",
      "translation": "代表任务待完成状态的 Future",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows the bean instance to perform validation of its overall\nconfiguration and final initialization when all bean properties have been set.",
      "translation": "此方法允许 Bean 实例在其所有属性设置完成后，执行其整体配置验证和最终初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The call might return immediately if the implementation uses\nan asynchronous execution strategy, or might block in the case\nof synchronous execution.",
      "translation": "如果实现采用异步执行策略，该调用可能会立即返回；而在同步执行的情况下，它可能会阻塞。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> after it has set all bean properties\nand satisfied <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, <code>ApplicationContextAware</code> etc.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在设置所有 bean 属性并满足<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>、<code>ApplicationContextAware</code>等接口后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
